---
description: SalkarsaUI design system rules for all UI code
globs: ["**/*.{tsx,jsx,ts,js,vue,svelte,css,scss,html,swift,kt}"]
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow @DESIGN.md and @AGENTS.md for every UI change.

- Use only semantic tokens from tokens/tokens.css, for example var(--bg-default), var(--spacing-md), var(--radius-md) and .text-body-md. No hex or px values, no primitive tokens.
- Reuse SalkarsaUI components and their props (DESIGN.md section 4).
- Touch targets at least 44px, a visible focus state, and aria-label on icon-only buttons.
- Light and dark themes are set with data-theme and share the same token names.
